 "summary": "All earlier api-design findings are resolved: the transfer lemmas are public and general (HasWeakFDerivOn, MemWkpLoc at every order on arbitrary sets, ContDiffOn), the new definitions have fderiv, zero and involutivity lemmas marked @[simp], and the duplicated private change-of-variables helpers are replaced by the public MemLpLoc.comp_continuousLinearEquiv_add and the existing LocallyIntegrableOn.comp_continuousLinearEquiv_of_mapsTo. The private helpers left in the file (negConj, adjointCLE, integral_comp_negConj) are one-line specialisations used only in this file, and deleting measurePreserving_negConj instead of exporting it is justified because the repo already writes conjLIE.measurePreserving inline.",
